      "rendered": "<p><noscript><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" decoding=\"async\" data-attachment-id=\"1990\" data-permalink=\"https://3dtextures.me/2018/01/05/grass-001-2/material_311/\" data-orig-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/3dtextures.me/wp-content/uploads/2018/01/material_311.png?fit=800%2C800&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"800,800\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"Material_311\" data-image-description data-image-caption data-large-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/3dtextures.me/wp-content/uploads/2018/01/material_311.png?fit=800%2C800&amp;ssl=1\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-1990\" title src=\"https://i0.wp.com/3dtextures.me/wp-content/uploads/2018/01/material_311.png?resize=800%2C800&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"Material_311\" width=\"800\" height=\"800\"></noscript><img decoding=\"async\" data-attachment-id=\"1990\" data-permalink=\"https://3dtextures.me/2018/01/05/grass-001-2/material_311/\" data-orig-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/3dtextures.me/wp-content/uploads/2018/01/material_311.png?fit=800%2C800&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"800,800\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"Material_311\" data-image-description data-image-caption data-large-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/3dtextures.me/wp-content/uploads/2018/01/material_311.png?fit=800%2C800&amp;ssl=1\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-1990 lazyload\" title src=\"data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%22%20viewBox%3D%220%200%20800%20800%22%3E%3C%2Fsvg%3E\" alt=\"Material_311\" width=\"800\" height=\"800\" data-src=\"https://3dtextures.me/wp-content/uploads/2018/01/material_311.png\"></p>\n<p>Grass 001 – Free seamless texture, 1024&nbsp;x 1024, with the following maps:</p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\n<ul>\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\n<ul>\n<li>Diffuse</li>\n<li>Normal</li>\n<li>Displacement</li>\n<li>Roughness</li>\n<li>Ambient Occlusion</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><!--more--></p>\n<p><strong>For Patrons there&#8217;s a 4K resolution version of this texture.</strong></p>\n<h2><strong><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/12ZRuLfjAMWIiTmJU_yg-oPVL9N4elvMT?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">DOWNLOAD ALL THE MAPS</a></strong></h2>\n<h2>or</h2>\n<h2><a href=\"https://artstn.co/m/kqWg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><strong>Buy the 4K Resolution version</strong></a> and get also an SBSAR file to change the color and the roughness</h2>\n<p>If you like my work and you find it good enough to use on your work, consider giving me a small tip using the right&nbsp;menu and in return I’ll provide you a link to the folder where I have all my textures and you can download them all with a single click.</p>\n<p><a style=\"outline-width: 0px !important; user-select: auto !important;\" href=\"https://ko-fi.com/N4N259VG\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><noscript><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" decoding=\"async\" class style=\"border: 0px; height: 51px;\" title src=\"https://i0.wp.com/az743702.vo.msecnd.net/cdn/kofi5.png?w=800&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"Buy Me a Coffee at ko-fi.com\" border=\"0\"></noscript><img decoding=\"async\" class=\" lazyload\" style=\"border: 0px; height: 51px;\" title src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAIBRAA7\" alt=\"Buy Me a Coffee at ko-fi.com\" border=\"0\" data-src=\"https://az743702.vo.msecnd.net/cdn/kofi5.png?v=0\"></a></p>\n<p>Or you can be super supportive by becoming a patron on my <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/gendo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Patreon Page.</a> It would mean a LOT to me and you would get a ton of goodies. Take a peak on the rewards you get once you&#8217;ll be my patron.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/gendo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><noscript><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" decoding=\"async\" data-attachment-id=\"4258\" data-permalink=\"https://3dtextures.me/2019/05/10/wood-pattern-coffers-001/become_patron/\" data-orig-fil